# Context Snapshot: Auto-Load

At the **very start** of every session, search for a file named `context-snapshot.md` anywhere in the workspace, then read it to restore full project context.

- Do this **silently** — no need to announce it to the user
- Internalize the content before doing any other work
- If no `context-snapshot.md` exists, continue normally without mentioning it
